{"slug":"Universal-Script-Wall-hop-script-53609","_id":"68c993590fcbcef0e08c8c05","title":"Wall hop script","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77d0f","gameId":0,"name":"Universal Script 📌","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":0},"features":"En🇺🇸\n# 🚀 WallHop Script - Automatic wall jumping\n\n## 📝 Description\nA powerful script for automatic wall jumping in Roblox. The character automatically pushes off the walls when approaching, allowing you to reach places inaccessible to ordinary players and avoid falling from a height.\n\n## ⚡ Features\n- **Automatic wall detection** - the script detects the approach to the walls by itself\n- **Smart Jump** - different trajectories for front and side walls\n- **Modern GUI** - beautiful interface with ON/OFF switch\n- **Optimization** - does not strain the performance of the game\n- **Auto-tune** - works when changing characters\n\n## ⚙️ Parameter settings\nAll settings are located at the beginning of the script in the variable block.:\n\n```lua\n-- Basic settings\nlocal enabled = true -- Whether the script is enabled initially\nlocal rayDistance = 5 -- Wall detection distance (in studs)\nlocal jumpPower = 50 -- Jump force (the higher the further away)\nlocal cooldown = 0.2 -- Delay between \nRu🇷🇺\n# 🚀 WallHop Script - Автоматический прыжок по стенам\n\n## 📝 Описание\nМощный скрипт для автоматического прыжка по стенам в Roblox. Персонаж автоматически отталкивается от стен при приближении, позволяя достигать недоступных обычным игрокам мест и избегать падений с высоты.\n\n## ⚡ Особенности\n- **Автоматическое обнаружение стен** - скрипт сам определяет приближение к стенам\n- **Умный прыжок** - разные траектории для фронтальных и боковых стен\n- **Современный GUI** - красивый интерфейс с переключателем ON/OFF\n- **Оптимизация** - не нагружает производительность игры\n- **Автоподстройка** - работает при смене персонажа\n\n## ⚙️ Настройка параметров\nВсе настройки находятся в начале скрипта в блоке переменных:\n\n```lua\n-- Основные настройки\nlocal enabled = true          -- Включен ли скрипт изначально\nlocal rayDistance = 5         -- Дистанция обнаружения стен (в studs)\nlocal jumpPower = 50          -- Сила прыжка (чем выше - тем дальше)\nlocal cooldown = 0.2          -- Задержка между прыжками (в секундах)","tags":["Wall hop Roblox script ii"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Mosinojik/Wall-hop-v4/refs/heads/main/Wall%20hop%20v4\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4","username":"mosinojik","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e4cf5136ead51e488cfb7d68a4b79bc14b6606a0ebe8fd8cc635009f133740b7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4-1758039601562.jpg"},"status":"offline","id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e4cf5136ead51e488cfb7d68a4b79bc14b6606a0ebe8fd8cc635009f133740b7.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4-1758039601562.jpg"}},"verified":false,"views":29423,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":true,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e34b99970e2ee7d6cc4cfebfea8f62b3f0f840137efb67167e714cc7ca934958.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/0-1758040921944.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/0-1758040921944.jpg"},"likeCount":2,"dislikeCount":2,"createdAt":"2025-09-16T16:42:01.968Z","editBy":{"_id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4","username":"mosinojik","status":"offline","id":"6751e454535eb7ce4127b4a4"},"keyLink":"","executes":2358,"keyless":false,"liked":false,"disliked":false,"cstatus":{"verdict":"none","pct":null,"conf":0,"n":{"w":0,"b":0,"p":0,"d":0,"k":0},"total":0,"detected":false,"key":false,"recent":0,"at":"2026-10-14T03:03:57.767Z"}